# rules.example.gamebuddy — a quick card, setup and scoring reference

[game]
name: Rule Book
players: 2-6
time: 10m
tags: reference, rules

[tool rules]
quick: Lowest score wins; ties share the win.
setup: Shuffle the deck, Deal five cards each, Put the rest in the middle
scoring: cards left=2, bonus tokens=5, completed sets=10
glossary: meeple=The little wooden person, trick=One round of played cards
source: https://example.com/rules
rules: |
  # Goal
  Finish with the fewest penalty points after three rounds.

  - Play one card each turn
  - Draw back up to five
  - The lowest total wins
